==Miscellaneous==
*Added 6 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**14,001 raises [[Superfeline (Normal Cat)|Superfeline]]'s level cap from 20+60 to 20+70
**15,001 raises Superfeline's level cap from 20+70 to 20+80
**18,800 grants +5 Super Rare [[Catseye]]s
**18,900 grants +5 Uber Rare Catseyes
**19,000 grants +1 Rare Ticket
**20,001 grants +3 Dark Catseyes
*Added 3 new [[Enigma Stages#Enigma Level|Enigma Levels]] (7 to 9).
*Added 4 new Medals (Bronze, Silver, Gold, Platinum), as the Underground Labyrinth's Final Rank reward.
*Added 1 new [[Catseye]]: Dark Catseye.
*Added 6 new [[Catfruit#Behemoth Stones|Behemoth Stones]]: Purple Behemoth Gem, Red Behemoth Gem, Blue Behemoth Gem, Green Behemoth Gem, Yellow Behemoth Gem and Epic Behemoth Stone.
**Behemoth Gems are made by combining 10 Behemoth Stones of one type together; for example, 10 Red Behemoth Stones = 1 Red Behemoth Gem.
*Added 2 new Easter eggs:
**Waiting on the [[Main Menu]] for long enough will lead to a [https://youtube.com/shorts/4IkdXY_07S0 brief animation] in which the [[Superfeline (Normal Cat)|True Superfeline]] on the logo blinks and wags its tail for a few seconds.
**On December 31st, the intro is replaced by an [https://youtu.be/SkSqWL-u7Vg alternate version] in which True Superfeline steadily approaches the player. At the end of the intro, the screen turns red.
*In the [[The Battle Cats|English version]], [[Cat Bros (Rare Cat)|Cat Bros]]' entry has been added to the [[Cat Dictionary|Cat Guide]].
*[[Blue Shinobi (Special Cat)|Blue Shinobi]] and [[Firecracker Cat (Special Cat)|Firecracker Cat]] are introduced to the English version via the [[Lunar New Year (Event Gacha)|Lunar New Year]] Event Gacha.
*Maximum [[Level-up]] changed for Uber Rare units from 50 -> 60 using [[Catseye|Dark Catseyes]].

